  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration Management Framework (MMF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program strengthens governments&#x2019; capacity to support evidence-based migration management and builds on the work done on IOM&#x2019;s Migration Governance Indicators (MGI). The MGI helps governments, upon request, take stock of their migration policies and strategies, to identify good practices as well as areas with potential for further development. By focusing on government ownership of the process, the MGI&#x2019;s ultimate objective is to help governments make progress on their migration management priorities and gradually improve their migration management systems. This program cycle envisages to conduct 28 MGI assessments at local and national level.</narrative>
  </description>
